class:: GroupedFDNModel
summary:: Prepared pairwise-coupled grouped feedback delay network
categories:: UGens>Reverbs, Libraries>CamaraObscura
related:: Guides/CamaraObscura, Classes/GroupedFDN

description::

GroupedFDNModel prepares delay lines, group-specific low/high T60 targets,
input/output residues, damping crossovers, and one Givens angle for every
group pair. Each group retains its own requested delay range. The architecture
follows the grouped-FDN work of Das, Abel, and Canfield-Dafilou; this is an
independent compact implementation.

At runtime, code::coupling:: scales every prepared Givens angle. The resulting
matrix is orthogonal for all control values before contractive attenuation is
applied. The closest vanilla UGen is link::Classes/FreeVerb::, but GroupedFDN
exposes distinct energy reservoirs and controllable exchange instead of one
fixed reverb topology.

classmethods::

method:: twoRooms
Prepare two four-line rooms.

argument:: smallT60
Low-band T60 of the smaller room in seconds.

argument:: largeT60
Low-band T60 of the larger room in seconds.

argument:: aperture
Symmetric pairwise coupling amount from 0 through 1.

argument:: sampleRate
Exact renderer sample rate.

argument:: seed
Deterministic delay-distribution seed.

method:: fromGroups
Prepare one through eight equally sized groups.

argument:: groupSpecs
Rows of code::[lowT60, highT60, minimumDelay, maximumDelay, lineCount]::.
All groups currently require the same line count; at most 32 lines are used.

argument:: couplingMatrix
Finite symmetric square matrix with unit diagonal. Upper-triangle magnitudes
from 0 through 1 map to pairwise Givens angles from zero through pi/4.

argument:: sampleRate
Exact renderer sample rate.

argument:: seed
Deterministic delay-distribution seed.

method:: read
Read a version-1 GroupedFDN model.

instancemethods::

method:: validate
Validate metadata, dimensions, every pair angle, and every delay-line entry.

method:: summary
Return concise prepared-model diagnostics.

method:: load
Upload the model to a mono Buffer.

method:: write
Serialize the model.

method:: free
Free the last uploaded Buffer.

method:: plotDecay
Plot the prepared group low/high T60 values.

method:: plotCoupling
Plot the reconstructed symmetric pairwise coupling matrix.

examples::

code::
(
var model = GroupedFDNModel.twoRooms(
    0.5, 4.5, 0.2, sampleRate: 48000, seed: 2
);
model.summary.postln;
model.plotDecay;
)
::

code::
(
var model = GroupedFDNModel.fromGroups(
    [
        [0.4, 0.25, 0.018, 0.05, 3],
        [1.2, 0.7, 0.04, 0.09, 3],
        [3.5, 1.8, 0.07, 0.13, 3]
    ],
    [
        [1, 0.1, 0.3],
        [0.1, 1, 0.8],
        [0.3, 0.8, 1]
    ],
    sampleRate: 48000,
    seed: 11
);
model.validate;
model.plotCoupling;
)
::

